  "description": "The reusable phasor-model engine from PrismFormer: define a model, train it data-parallel through an EvalApp pipeline, and run inference (predict / generate, with an optional KV cache). Ships two param-for-param comparable cores — AlgFormer (softmax dot-product attention) and HoloFormer (holographic-native attention: bind the key to its value, causally bundle into one superposed memory trace, then resonate the query to retrieve, O(T·d) with O(1) KV-serve) — plus HoloShape capacity-law sizing. Pure double[] + SIMD, no external ML runtime. Built on the Phasor VSA codec and the EvalApp pipeline runtime.",
